sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend as React Frontend
    participant API as NestJS API
    participant DocSvc as Documents Service
    participant StreamMod as Streaming Module<br/>(Kafka Producer)
    participant Kafka as Kafka (documents_uploaded)
    participant Parser as Doc Parser Consumer
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant AnomSvc as Anomalies Service
    participant AISvc as AI Assistant Service
    participant LLM as LLM Provider

    User->>Frontend: Select PDF & click Upload
    Frontend->>API: POST /documents/upload (multipart)
    API->>DocSvc: validate + save metadata + file
    DocSvc->>DB: insert into documents
    DocSvc->>StreamMod: publish documents_uploaded event
    StreamMod->>Kafka: documents_uploaded

    Kafka-->>Parser: consume documents_uploaded
    Parser->>DB: insert rows into document_transactions
    Parser->>AnomSvc: (sync call or via message) trigger anomaly computation
    AnomSvc->>DB: read transactions for document
    AnomSvc->>DB: insert anomaly_events + update document_risk_summary

    User->>Frontend: Open document detail page
    Frontend->>API: GET /documents/{id} + /documents/{id}/anomalies
    API->>DB: read document + transactions + anomalies
    API-->>Frontend: JSON response (doc, txns, anomalies)

    User->>Frontend: Click "Explain anomalies"
    Frontend->>API: POST /ai/explain-document/{id}
    API->>AISvc: build context (doc + anomalies + stats)
    AISvc->>LLM: send prompt
    LLM-->>AISvc: explanation text
    AISvc-->>Frontend: explanation
    Frontend-->>User: render explanation in AI panel
